      "content": "i get that, but is it really an \"impossible\" situation? i've seen some dev groups use custom wrapper scripts or loose JSON mapping to bridge these kinds of gaps without a full middleware setup. if we just did a lite version of the integration—not a perfect one, just enough to get the data flowing—could we stay on track? if i tell the board we can skip the heavy middleware phase, i need to be sure it's actually a technical blocker and not just a \"best practice\" thing.",
